                "runProperty": Object {},
              },
              "type": "run",
            },
            Object {
              "data": Object {
                "children": Array [
                  Object {
                    "data": Object {
                      "preserveSpace": true,
                      "text": " is less than unanimous, such action by written consent may be in lieu of holding an annual meeting only if all of the directorships to which directors could be elected at an annual meeting held at the effective time of such action are vacant and are filled by such action. Any other proper business may be transacted at the annual meeting.",
