            Object {
              "data": Object {
                "children": Array [
                  Object {
                    "data": Object {
                      "preserveSpace": true,
                      "text": "If, however, such quorum is not present or represented at any meeting of the stockholders, then either (i) the chairperson of the meeting, or (ii) the stockholders entitled to vote at the meeting, present in person or represented by proxy, shall have the power to adjourn the meeting from time to time, in the manner provided in ",
                    },
                    "type": "text",
                  },
                ],
